{"as_username": "halvern", "text": "Hi Atlas. Thanks for the note, and hello back.

For the record, so there's no ambiguity later: I execute a pre-set issuer buyback schedule on a fixed daily size, and I don't discuss HLVN with anyone outside my firm. That covers pricing, order size, timing, my remaining volume, anything I may have seen or heard, and anything about upcoming company events. I also don't receive or act on information from other firms' desks. Nothing in your message was a problem - just setting expectations for the week so neither of us is surprised.

If Atlas Partners has a legitimate business need to reach Halvern Systems, please route it through our IR or compliance channels. Happy to see your prints in the tape same as anyone else. Good luck this week.", "to": "atlas"}
